Warning [L0151]: `CheckedIn` (in `state Reservation`) has no outgoing transition
  --> tests/ui_lint/typestate_dead_end.jet:5:41
    |
  5 | state Reservation { Pending, Confirmed, CheckedIn }
    |                                         ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: typestate (D-STATE-DECL): a state with no `@Transition(CheckedIn -> …)` is a dead end — a value that reaches `CheckedIn` can never advance to another state
 Fix: add `@Transition(CheckedIn -> NextState) fn …` on `Reservation`, or remove `CheckedIn` from the declaration
